          {
            "level": 0,
            "message": "Attempts will be made to complete the CTF process but the report may be incomplete."
          },
          {
            "level": 0,
            "message": "Constructs reported after this construction may appear to have all 0 CTFs."
          },
          {
            "level": 0,
            "message": "The potential causes of this problem are related to the input for the construction"
          },
          {
            "level": 0,
            "message": "listed in the severe error above.  The CTF calculate routine is unable to come up"
          },
          {
            "level": 0,
            "message": "with a series of CTF terms that have a reasonable time step and this indicates an"
          },
          {
            "level": 0,
            "message": "error.  Check the definition of this construction and the materials that make up"
          },
          {
            "level": 0,
            "message": "the construction.  Very thin, highly conductive materials may cause problems."
          },
          {
            "level": 0,
            "message": "This may be avoided by ignoring the presence of those materials since they probably"
